{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"more_loop\": \"Y\",\n  \"x_loops\": [\n    \"S02-S04：在舍不得从前的自在、亲近，与想起受过的委屈、怀疑当初是否走对之间来回摆。S04进一步想象如果没走会怎样，但仍停留在去留对错的追问上。\",\n    \"S07-S10：从害怕孤单、怀疑当初离开是否正确，到暂时把回去放一边，再到辨析自己究竟为什么想回去，反复绕回离开与回头的矛盾。不过S09-S10逐渐把想回去的动机和现实顾虑说得更清楚。\",\n    \"S10-S11：S10怀疑回去能否恢复从前的亲近，S11又对那份亲近能否找回来抱有侥幸，存在一定重复；但S11随后转向先把眼下日子过稳，带出了新的行动方向。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_loops\": [\n    \"S02-S04：在舍不得从前的自在、亲近，与想起受过的委屈、怀疑当初是否走对之间来回摆。S04进一步想象如果没走会怎样，但仍停留在去留对错的追问上。\",\n    \"S07-S10：从害怕孤单、怀疑当初离开是否正确，到暂时把回去放一边，再到辨析自己究竟为什么想回去，反复绕回离开与回头的矛盾。不过S09-S10逐渐把想回去的动机和现实顾虑说得更清楚。\",\n    \"S10-S11：S10已经问过真的回去还能不能像从前那样，S11又明确重复回去未必找得回那份亲近，却再问万一能呢。两段几乎在重复同一个关于回去能否恢复亲近的疑问，新增推进较少。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"两条的主体结构几乎相同，都有怀念亲近、想起委屈、害怕孤单、重新考虑回头的反复。Y主要在S11再次直接重开S10已经提出的问题，而X的S11更侧重对亲近本身残存的希望，并较明确地转向先安顿当下，因此Y更像在原地打转。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "078d9cf4-327f-4198-ac3a-1ba15fda4be6", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T102314695305Z", "elapsed_seconds": 43.125, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T10:23:57.820281+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "75154422ecda347ea0e8bc46388fb5c69d218da912826525ed38fe6ad2dd358d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T102314695305Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "7b2650bd53e2f01126ef4304b44342134a92ca3da6e3b80559338cfa1ade2deb"}}}
